# ---------------------------------------------------------------- equivalent facts (REWORK-PLAN 3.3)
@fact switch.recreated
about: Lamb pulled the quay switch and Mother went out with the quay. She is on the board, and whoever pulls it puts her out.
against: guild 15
against: trust 15
by: Lamb's own hand

@fact afterdark.told
about: Marrow told it to someone who fought fair in the dark: the switch at 21:38, back at 21:52, as his father did.
against: guild 25
by: testimony, earned

@fact works.inferred
about: The weigh-house ledger closed for Trust works seven months ago, the blotter's backward signatures, and Crake's "seven months": Mother was moved onto the quay board, by the Board and the Trust.
against: keel 20
against: trust 25
by: inference

@fact oven.inferred
about: Soot streaked east before the rain, bottle glass in the pool below the Brine, and the oven door dried in the shape of a hand: the green prisms are cast at the Brine.
against: wenna 15
against: sabine 15
by: inference

@fact wenna.told_landing
about: On the landing of the hundred and twelve stairs, carried most of the way, Wenna said she has not climbed at night in three years and heard Mother stop.
against: wenna 25
by: testimony

@fact scales.kept
about: Lamb covered the switch handle before the rain and kept the scales on it: a Guild hand on the switch, preserved.
against: guild 20
by: Lamb's oilskin

@fact appt.known
about: Something is planned for the next time the lights go out. HEARSAY and the Glass agree.

@fact appt.stopped
@fact appt.joined
@fact appt.watched
